{"id": "ce856c02-3b59-492c-9bf2-80bed8a190fe", "slug": "zenith-unified-architecture", "title": "Zenith - Unified Architecture", "description": "Zenith Unified Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Zenith - Unified Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Zenith Unified Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F0EFEB\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#F0EFEB\"\n  background: \"#F0EFEB\"\n  surface: \"#E8E7E2\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Zenith - Unified Architecture\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 119; favorites: 5; remixes: 4.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nZenith Unified Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nZenith Platform Solutions Company Insights Sign In Architecture Spec v1.0 Unified State Environment. Synchronize disparate data pipelines into a singular, high-fidelity construct. Engineered for absolute velocity and ze…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unified State Environment..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F0EFEB, secondary #000000, accent #F0EFEB, background #F0EFEB, surface #E8E7E2, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Zenith - Unified Architecture</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full bg-[#F0EFEB] text-neutral-900 overflow-x-hidden font-sans selection:bg-orange-600 selection:text-white\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Base & Noise Layer -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none bg-[#F0EFEB]\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\\'0 0 200 200\\' xmlns=\\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\\'noiseFilter\\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\\'fractalNoise\\' baseFrequency=\\'0.8\\' numOctaves=\\'3\\' stitchTiles=\\'stitch\\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\\'100%25\\' height=\\'100%25\\' filter=\\'url(%23noiseFilter)\\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); opacity: 0.03; mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid Traces -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none flex justify-center w-full max-w-[1920px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12\">\n        <div class=\"w-full h-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-0 border-x border-black/10\">\n            <div class=\"col-start-5 border-r border-black/10 h-full hidden md:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"col-start-9 border-r border-black/10 h-full hidden md:block opacity-50\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL/Canvas Atmosphere Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"atmosphere-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[2] pointer-events-none opacity-[0.25] mix-blend-multiply\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Scaffold -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen w-full max-w-[1920px] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 py-6 w-full border-b border-black/10 bg-[#F0EFEB]/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <!-- Brand -->\n            <div class=\"w-1/4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 group relative z-20\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black block group-hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors duration-300\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight uppercase text-black\">Zenith</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center justify-center gap-10 w-1/2\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    Platform <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"opacity-50\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    Solutions <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"opacity-50\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors\">Company</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors\">Insights</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Right Action -->\n            <div class=\"w-1/4 flex justify-end relative z-20\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"w-px h-3 bg-black/20 block\"></span>\n                    Sign In\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Asymmetrical Hero Stage -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 relative border-b border-black/10\">\n\n            <!-- Left Typographic Column -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-8 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 md:px-12 py-20 md:py-32 relative z-20\">\n\n                <!-- Utility Meta Label -->\n                <div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase mb-12 flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <span class=\"w-8 h-[2px] bg-orange-600 block\"></span>\n                    Architecture Spec v1.0\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline with Masked Reveal -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem] leading-[0.92] tracking-tighter font-normal text-black max-w-[54rem] gs-reveal-title\">\n                    Unified State Environment.\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Editorial Split: Supporting text + CTA -->\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start max-w-[54rem]\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed font-light gs-reveal-fade\">\n                        Synchronize disparate data pipelines into a singular, high-fidelity construct. Engineered for absolute velocity and zero environmental fragmentation.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"gs-reveal-fade md:justify-self-end w-full md:w-auto\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-between md:justify-start gap-6 px-8 py-4 bg-black text-white hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden w-full md:w-auto\">\n                            <span class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-orange-600 scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left duration-500\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest font-normal\">Initialize State</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span>[ REQ-049 ]</span>\n                            <span class=\"w-full h-px bg-black/10 block md:hidden\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Cinematic Media Column -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-4 flex flex-col border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-black/10 bg-[#E8E7E2] relative z-10\">\n\n                <!-- Technical Metadata Block -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 md:p-10 border-b border-black/10 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest space-y-5\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-black/10 pb-2\">\n                        <span>Node Sync</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-black flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-600 animate-pulse block\"></span>\n                            Active\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-black/10 pb-2\">\n                        <span>Latency</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-black\">1.04ms</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-black/10 pb-2\">\n                        <span>Protocol</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-black\">Z-CORE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Cinematic Inset Panel -->\n                <div class=\"relative flex-grow min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[auto] p-6 md:p-10\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-6 md:inset-10 bg-cover bg-center grayscale-[0.8] contrast-125 border border-black/15 shadow-inner\"\n                         style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1682687220063-4742bd7fd538?q=80&w=3540&auto=format&fit=crop'); background-position: center 70%;\">\n\n                        <!-- Narrative Image Traces -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/5 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 h-px bg-white/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-px bg-white/20\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Crosshair Accent -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-orange-600\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Panel Metadata -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-mono text-xs text-white/80 tracking-widest\">\n                            IMG_SEQ_01\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 font-mono text-xs text-white/80 tracking-widest bg-black/40 px-2 py-1 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10\">\n                            REC\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Anchored Utility -->\n        <footer class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 py-6 w-full bg-[#F0EFEB] relative z-20 gap-4 md:gap-0\">\n            <div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400\">\n                Zenith Labs © 2024\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors relative group\">\n                    Twitter\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-black scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left\"></span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors relative group\">\n                    GitHub\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-black scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left\"></span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-neutral-500 hover:text-black transition-colors relative group\">\n                    Discord\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-black scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left\"></span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- 1. Masked Word Reveal Helper (Inline styling to meet constraints) ---\n            function wrapWords(element) {\n                const text = element.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                element.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'mask-inner-target'; // Class used strictly for GSAP targeting\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(120%)';\n                    inner.style.willChange = 'transform';\n                    inner.innerHTML = word + (index < words.length - 1 ? '&nbsp;' : '');\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    element.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n                return element.querySelectorAll('.mask-inner-target');\n            }\n\n            const title = document.querySelector('.gs-reveal-title');\n            if (title) {\n                const titleWords = wrapWords(title);\n\n                // --- 2. GSAP Animations ---\n                const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                    defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" }\n                });\n\n                // Animate masked words\n                tl.to(titleWords, {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 1.4,\n                    stagger: 0.04,\n                    delay: 0.1\n                });\n\n                // Fade in support text and CTA\n                tl.fromTo(\".gs-reveal-fade\",\n                    { opacity: 0, y: 15 },\n                    { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.15 },\n                    \"-=0.9\"\n                );\n            }\n\n            // Header fade in\n            gsap.fromTo(\"header\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: -10 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1.5, ease: \"power3.out\", delay: 0.2 }\n            );\n\n            // Tech Meta block fade in\n            gsap.fromTo(\".border-t .font-mono\",\n                { opacity: 0, x: 10 },\n                { opacity: 1, x: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power2.out\", delay: 0.6 }\n            );\n\n            // --- 3. Subtle Canvas Atmosphere (Engineered Grid Lines & Drift) ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('atmosphere-canvas');\n            if (canvas) {\n                const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n                let width, height;\n                let particles = [];\n\n                function resize() {\n                    width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                    height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                }\n                window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n                resize();\n\n                class Particle {\n                    constructor() {\n                        this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                        this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                        this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3; // Very slow drift\n                        this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                    }\n                    update() {\n                        this.x += this.vx;\n                        this.y += this.vy;\n                        // Wrap around\n                        if (this.x < 0) this.x = width;\n                        if (this.x > width) this.x = 0;\n                        if (this.y < 0) this.y = height;\n                        if (this.y > height) this.y = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Sparse particle network representing data nodes\n                for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) {\n                    particles.push(new Particle());\n                }\n\n                function animateCanvas() {\n                    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                    // Technical thin strokes\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)';\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n\n                    // Update and draw connections\n                    for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                        particles[i].update();\n\n                        // Draw small technical markers at node positions\n                        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.15)';\n                        ctx.fillRect(particles[i].x, particles[i].y, 1, 1);\n\n                        for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                            const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                            const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                            // Draw rigid connection line if close enough\n                            if (dist < 180) {\n                                ctx.beginPath();\n                                ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                                ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                                ctx.stroke();\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n                }\n                animateCanvas();\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "zenith-unified-architecture.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/zenith-unified-architecture.jpg", "source_name": "zenith-unified-architecture-DESIGN.md", "views": 301, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T00:44:46.434433+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T09:14:56.542534+00:00"}